7bcb66e46d09"],

Cell["\<\
Finally, we apply the updated engine to re-derive the Riemann curvature \
tensor from the torsion-free commutator of covariant derivatives.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980797480290036*^9, 3.9807975089154177`*^9}, {
  3.980797618327881*^9, 
  3.980797637791888*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1e0c508b-f71b-4bb3-a8cd-\
fded5237b847"]
}, Open  ]],

